WEBVTT

00:00:00.099 --> 00:00:01.579
My name is Mohamed Hussein Mohamed.

00:00:02.379 --> 00:00:07.179
I would like to thank A&A Trade Solutions,
which supplied me with

00:00:07.179 --> 00:00:10.179
the equipment I needed from China

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:14.919
to open this new business. Among the
services the company provided me was

00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:20.039
searching the Chinese markets to find
exactly what I was looking for

00:00:20.039 --> 00:00:24.079
and what we wanted to order. The company
also kept us regularly updated,

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:29.119
letting us know how things were progressing
and keeping us informed throughout.

00:00:29.119 --> 00:00:33.439
They helped us find the items that matched
my preferences. Once we made our choices,

00:00:33.439 --> 00:00:37.399
they sourced equipment of very high quality
for us,

00:00:37.399 --> 00:00:41.779
and they also found it at a very affordable
price that we were happy with.

00:00:41.779 --> 00:00:46.879
After we purchased the goods at the agreed
price, the company arranged everything for us.

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:51.219
In the end, they delivered our equipment
safely and on time.

00:00:51.219 --> 00:00:55.459
It is an excellent company. They are a
company that can bring goods from China

00:00:55.459 --> 00:00:59.299
with a very high standard of quality.
I am very grateful to A&A

00:00:59.299 --> 00:01:03.299
Trade Solutions. To everyone in the
community, I would say:

00:01:03.299 --> 00:01:04.579
don't miss out on their services.

00:01:12.879 --> 00:01:13.459
[Outro music]
